('monsters', 'tier_change_cooldown_seconds', NULL, 10.0, 'seconds', 'security.md G10 (brief claude-world-security-fixes 2026-09-30): minimum time between two player tier changes; blank means no cooldown. Ruling 2026-09-30, q-0930-06'),
